================================================================================
Modification notice (GPL-3.0, section 5a)
================================================================================

PiliGlass is a modified version of PiliPlus
(https://github.com/bggRGjQaUbCoE/PiliPlus, GPL-3.0), which in turn derives
from PiliPalaX (https://github.com/orz12/PiliPalaX) and pilipala
(https://github.com/guozhigq/pilipala).

Modified by Xstars3279 since 2026; first released as v0.1.0 on 2026-10-23.
The modifications are mainly to the user interface: the liquid glass dock,
rail and surfaces, spring animations, the redesigned pages, and the in-app
updater. Every change, with its date and author, is recorded in the git
history of https://github.com/Xstars3279/PiliGlass.


